{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T11:32:46Z","thinking":"Determining the necessary components for the front-end application begins with outlining the core UI elements. Initial focus lies on developing the `renderNavigation()` component. This necessitates a header featuring the FeedForward logo and a circular badge. Partition and role tabs will then be constructed for user selection, encompassing Student/Hosteller, Head Chef (Demand Forecast), Gatekeeper (Canteen Entry & Strike Desk), Events & Restaurants, and Biogas Official (M).\n\n\nNow considering the structure of the hosteller view, detailed student profiles will be included with a visual indicator of food wastage strikes and potential fines. Interactive forms will enable meal selection, attendance confirmation, dietary choices, and customizable portion sizes for each upcoming meal. The design aims for clear communication of status and ease of meal RSVP.\n\n\nNow focusing on the chef's view, the display will show partitioned meal summaries and cooking preparation sheets. The design incorporates headcount cards, with options for meal customization based on dietary needs. Further development is necessary to include a mechanism for marking kitchen preparation completion and menu publishing.\n\n\nFocus is now on the meal service module; successful RSVPs trigger a green modal with portion details, while opt-outs or unregistered students receive warnings. The Plate Waste & Penalty Issuer allows quick assignment of black stars for wastage or no-shows, with automatic fine notifications at three stars, alongside a No-Show Audit List for easy penalty application.\n\nThe WasteHubView's structure involves a form to log waste segregation, categorizing it for animal feed or biogas, and logging the quantity. Active dispatches are tracked with status cards, and circular sustainability metrics will track total waste diverted.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * FeedForward Main Application Controller\n * Handles view rendering, role switching, interactive meal selections,\n * black star meters, gatekeeper entry checks, and circular waste logistics.\n */\n\nimport { state } from './state.js';\nimport { api } from './api.js';\n\n// DOM Containers\nconst appContainer = document.getElementById('app');\n\nfunction initApp() {\n  state.subscribe(() => render());\n  state.init();\n}\n\nfunction render() {\n  if (!appContainer) return;\n  appContainer.innerHTML = `\n    ${renderNavbar()}\n    <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8\">\n      ${renderRoleView()}\n    </main>\n    ${renderNotificationsModal()}\n  `;\n  attachEventListeners();\n}\n\n// ----------------- NAVBAR & ROLE SWITCHER -----------------\n\nfunction renderNavbar() {\n  const roles = [\n    { id: 'student', label: 'Hosteller (Student)', icon: 'graduation-cap', partition: 'Hostel' },\n    { id: 'chef', label: 'Head Chef (Kitchen Demand)', icon: 'utensils', partition: 'Hostel/Kitchen' },\n    { id: 'gatekeeper', label: 'Canteen Gatekeeper', icon: 'scan-line', partition: 'Canteen Entry' },\n    { id: 'event_manager', label: 'Events & Restaurants', icon: 'calendar-heart', partition: 'Banquets/Events' },\n    { id: 'biogas_official', label: 'Biogas Management', icon: 'flame', partition: 'Circular Energy' },\n    { id: 'animal_official', label: 'Animal Feed Partner', icon: 'paw-print', partition: 'Shelter Rescue' }\n  ];\n\n  const currentRoleObj = roles.find(r => r.id === state.currentRole) || roles[0];\n  const userList = state.allUsers.filter(u => u.role === state.currentRole);\n\n  return `\n    <header class=\"bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-xs\">\n      <!-- Top Banner for Sustainability Metrics -->\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 text-xs py-2 px-4\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-medium\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n            <span class=\"text-white font-semibold\">FeedForward Platform:</span> Zero-Waste Food Intelligence & Circular Redistribution\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs\">\n            <span>🌾 Saved Food: <b class=\"text-emerald-400\">${state.analytics.prevented_waste_kg || 0} kg</b></span>\n            <span>⚡ Biogas Generated: <b class=\"text-amber-400\">${state.analytics.biogas_m3 || 0} m³ (${state.analytics.green_kwh || 0} kWh)</b></span>\n            <span>🐾 Animal Meals: <b class=\"text-sky-400\">${state.analytics.animal_meals || 0} meals</b></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Main Navigation Bar -->\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center h-18\">\n          <!-- Logo -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-600 to-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"leaf\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 brand-font\">Feed<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Forward</span></span>\n              <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\">Food Waste Redirection System</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Role Switcher Pills -->\n          <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80\">\n            ${roles.map(r => `\n              <button \n                data-role=\"${r.id}\" \n                class=\"role-switch-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all ${\n                  state.currentRole === r.id \n                    ? 'bg-white text-emerald-700 shadow-xs border border-slate-200/60' \n                    : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'\n                }\"\n              >\n                <i data-lucide=\"${r.icon}\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n                ${r.label.split(' ')[0]}\n              </button>\n            `).join('')}\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- User Persona Selector & Notifications -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <!-- Persona Switcher -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs\">\n              <span class=\"text-slate-400 font-medium\">Active:</span>\n              <select id=\"userSelector\" class=\"bg-transparent font-semibold text-slate-800 outline-hidden cursor-pointer\">\n                ${userList.map(u => `\n                  <option value=\"${u.id}\" ${state.currentUser?.id === u.id ? 'selected' : ''}>\n                    ${u.name} (${u.room_or_dept || u.role})\n                  </option>\n                `).join('')}\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Notifications Bell -->\n            <button id=\"openNotifsBtn\" class=\"relative p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"bell\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n              ${state.unreadNotifsCount > 0 ? `\n                <span class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center ring-2 ring-white\">\n                  ${state.unreadNotifsCount}\n                </span>\n              ` : ''}\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Mobile Role Selector Dropdown -->\n      <div class=\"lg:hidden px-4 pb-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Portal View:</span>\n        <select id=\"mobileRoleSelector\" class=\"text-xs bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded px-2 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n          ${roles.map(r => `\n            <option value=\"${r.id}\" ${state.currentRole === r.id ? 'selected' : ''}>${r.label}</option>\n          `).join('')}\n        </select>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- ROLE VIEW ROUTER -----------------\n\nfunction renderRoleView() {\n  switch (state.currentRole) {\n    case 'student':\n      return renderHostellerView();\n    case 'chef':\n      return renderChefView('hostel');\n    case 'event_manager':\n      return renderChefView('event');\n    case 'gatekeeper':\n      return renderGatekeeperView();\n    case 'biogas_official':\n    case 'animal_official':\n      return renderWasteHubView();\n    default:\n      return renderHostellerView();\n  }\n}\n\n// ----------------- 1. HOSTELLER / STUDENT PORTAL -----------------\n\nfunction renderHostellerView() {\n  const user = state.currentUser || {};\n  const stars = user.black_stars || 0;\n  const fines = user.fines_accumulated || 0;\n  const currentMeal = state.meals.find(m => m.id === state.selectedMealId) || state.meals[0] || {};\n  const currentRes = user.reservations?.find(r => r.meal_id === currentMeal.id);\n  const isAttending = currentRes ? currentRes.attending === 1 : true;\n  const selectedDiet = currentRes?.dietary_choice || 'Veg';\n  const existingQuantities = currentRes?.quantities || {};\n\n  // Available items for selected meal & diet\n  const vegItems = currentMeal.veg_items || [];\n  const nonVegItems = currentMeal.non_veg_items || [];\n  const activeItems = selectedDiet === 'Non-Veg' ? nonVegItems : vegItems;\n\n  return `\n    <div class=\"space-y-8 tab-content-enter\">\n      <!-- Welcome & Black Star Gamified Banner -->\n      <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 to-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-6\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-xs text-emerald-300 mb-2\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n              Hostel Resident Portal (${user.room_or_dept || 'Block A'})\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Welcome, ${user.name || 'Student'}!</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm mt-1 max-w-xl\">\n              Confirm your upcoming meal attendance and exact portion quantities below so the mess kitchen prepares only what is consumed.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Black Star Meter Card -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/15 min-w-[280px]\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-semibold mb-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-slate-300\">Food Waste Penalty Meter</span>\n              <span class=\"${stars >= 3 ? 'text-rose-400 font-bold' : stars > 0 ? 'text-amber-400' : 'text-emerald-400'}\">\n                ${stars} / 3 Strikes\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Visual 3-Star Slots -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 my-2\">\n              <div class=\"star-slot ${stars >= 1 ? 'star-filled' : 'star-empty'}\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"star\" class=\"w-5 h-5 ${stars >= 1 ? 'fill-amber-400 stroke-amber-400' : 'stroke-slate-400'}\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"star-slot ${stars >= 2 ? 'star-filled' : 'star-empty'}\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"star\" class=\"w-5 h-5 ${stars >= 2 ? 'fill-amber-400 stroke-amber-400' : 'stroke-slate-400'}\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"star-slot ${stars >= 3 ? 'star-filled star-fine-alert' : 'star-empty'}\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"star\" class=\"w-5 h-5 ${stars >= 3 ? 'fill-white stroke-white' : 'stroke-slate-400'}\"></i>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Fine Status Alert -->\n            ${stars >= 3 ? `\n              <div class=\"mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[11px] text-rose-300 block font-semibold\">Fine Levied: ₹${fines}</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-300\">3 strikes exceeded</span>\n                </div>\n                <button id=\"payFineBtn\" data-user-id=\"${user.id}\" data-amount=\"${fines}\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition shadow-sm\">\n                  Pay & Reset\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            ` : `\n              <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-300 mt-2\">\n                ${stars === 0 ? '✨ Clean Record! Keep avoiding food waste.' : '⚠️ Warning: Reaching 3 Black Stars incurs a ₹100 fine.'}\n              </p>\n            `}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Meal Selection & Digital Pass Grid -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <!-- Left 2 Cols: Meal Attendance & Portion Selector -->\n        <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Active Menu</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Cutoff: <b class=\"text-slate-800\">${currentMeal.cutoff_time || 'Soon'}</b></span>\n              </div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1\">${currentMeal.title || 'Hostel Meal'}</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">${currentMeal.location} • ${currentMeal.meal_date}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Meal Switcher Dropdown -->\n            <select id=\"mealSelector\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-slate-700 outline-hidden\">\n              ${state.meals.map(m => `\n                <option value=\"${m.id}\" ${state.selectedMealId === m.id ? 'selected' : ''}>\n                  ${m.title} (${m.meal_type})\n                </option>\n              `).join('')}\n            </select>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Step 1: Attendance Confirmation -->\n          <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">\n              1. Will you attend this meal? (100% Commitment)\n            </label>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <button \n                type=\"button\" \n                id=\"btnAttendYes\" \n                class=\"attendance-btn p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 transition-all ${\n                  isAttending \n                    ? 'border-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 font-bold shadow-xs' \n                    : 'border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-600'\n                }\"\n              >\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full ${isAttending ? 'bg-emerald-600 text-white' : 'bg-slate-200'} flex items-center justify-center text-xs\">\n                  ✓\n                </div>\n                <span>Yes, I will eat</span>\n              </button>\n\n              <button \n                type=\"button\" \n                id=\"btnAttendNo\" \n                class=\"attendance-btn p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 transition-all ${\n                  !isAttending \n                    ? 'border-rose-500 bg-rose-50 text-rose-900 font-bold shadow-xs' \n                    : 'border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-600'\n                }\"\n              >\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full ${!isAttending ? 'bg-rose-500 text-white' : 'bg-slate-200'} flex items-center justify-center text-xs\">\n                  ✕\n                </div>\n                <span>No, I'm skipping</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            ${!isAttending ? `\n              <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"info\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0\"></i>\n                <span>Thank you for letting us know! You helped prevent ~450g of cooked food overproduction.</span>\n              </div>\n            ` : ''}\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Step 2: Veg vs Non-Veg Dietary Choice (Shown if attending) -->\n          <div id=\"dietarySection\" class=\"${isAttending ? 'space-y-3' : 'hidden'}\">\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">\n              2. Select Your Dietary Preference\n            </label>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              <button \n                type=\"button\" \n                id=\"btnSelectVeg\" \n                class=\"diet-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 transition-all ${\n                  selectedDiet === 'Veg' \n                    ? 'border-green-600 bg-green-50 text-green-900 font-bold' \n                    : 'border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-600'\n                }\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border-2 border-green-600 flex items-center justify-center p-0.5\">\n                  <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-600\"></span>\n                </span>\n                <span>Pure Vegetarian</span>\n              </button>\n\n              <button \n                type=\"button\" \n                id=\"btnSelectNonVeg\" \n                class=\"diet-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 transition-all ${\n                  selectedDiet === 'Non-Veg' \n                    ? 'border-red-600 bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-bold' \n                    : 'border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-600'\n                }\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border-2 border-red-600 flex items-center justify-center p-0.5\">\n                  <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-600\"></span>\n                </span>\n                <span>Non-Vegetarian</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Step 3: Exact Item-Level Quantity Selection -->\n          <div id=\"quantitySection\" class=\"${isAttending ? 'space-y-4' : 'hidden'}\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">\n                3. Choose Exact Quantity You Will Eat\n              </label>\n              <span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Specify pieces to help chef prepare exact count</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n              ${activeItems.map(item => {\n                const currentQty = existingQuantities[item.item] !== undefined ? existingQuantities[item.item] : item.default;\n                return `\n                  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <div>\n                      <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">${item.item}</h4>\n                      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">${item.unit || 'portions'}</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n                      <button \n                        type=\"button\" \n                        class=\"qty-decrement qty-btn text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded\" \n                        data-item=\"${item.item}\"\n                        data-min=\"${item.min || 0}\"\n                      >\n                        -\n                      </button>\n                      <span class=\"w-6 text-center font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 item-qty-val\" id=\"qty_${item.item.replace(/\\s+/g, '_')}\">\n                        ${currentQty}\n                      </span>\n                      <button \n                        type=\"button\" \n                        class=\"qty-increment qty-btn text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded\" \n                        data-item=\"${item.item}\"\n                        data-max=\"${item.max || 10}\"\n                      >\n                        +\n                      </button>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                `;\n              }).join('')}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Save Button -->\n          <div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\">\n            <button \n              id=\"saveReservationBtn\" \n              class=\"w-full py-3.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 active:scale-[0.99] text-white font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"\n            >\n              <i data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n              Confirm Selection & Update Canteen Entry Pass\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Col: Digital Canteen Pass & Incident Logs -->\n        <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n          <!-- Boarding Pass Style Digital Ticket -->\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl relative border border-slate-700\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-700 pb-4\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-emerald-400\">Hostel Dining Pass</span>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">${user.name}</h3>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-xs bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                ${currentRes?.entry_status === 'entered' ? 'CHECKED IN' : isAttending ? 'RSVP ACTIVE' : 'OPTED OUT'}\n              </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"py-4 space-y-3 text-xs\">\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Meal:</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold\">${currentMeal.title || 'Lunch'}</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Preference:</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold ${selectedDiet === 'Non-Veg' ? 'text-rose-400' : 'text-emerald-400'}\">\n                  ${isAttending ? selectedDiet : 'Not Attending'}\n                </span>\n              </div>\n              ${isAttending && Object.keys(existingQuantities).length > 0 ? `\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 space-y-1\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold\">Planned Portions:</span>\n                  ${Object.entries(existingQuantities).map(([k, v]) => `\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[11px]\">\n                      <span>${k}</span>\n                      <span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-300\">${v}</span>\n                    </div>\n                  `).join('')}\n                </div>\n              ` : ''}\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Simulated QR Code Container -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 text-center text-slate-900 mt-2\">\n              <div class=\"w-28 h-28 mx-auto bg-slate-100 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2\">\n                <i data-lucide=\"qr-code\" class=\"w-20 h-20 text-slate-800\"></i>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-2\">SCAN AT CANTEEN ENTRY</span>\n              <span class=\"block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700\">ID: ${user.id}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Strike History Card -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"history\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-500\"></i>\n              Penalty & Wastage History\n            </h3>\n            ${user.star_logs && user.star_logs.length > 0 ? `\n              <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                ${user.star_logs.map(log => `\n                  <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between font-bold\">\n                      <span class=\"text-rose-600 flex items-center gap-1\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"alert-circle\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n                        ${log.reason}\n                      </span>\n                      <span class=\"text-slate-800\">${log.current_stars} ⭐</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500\">\n                      <span>${new Date(log.timestamp).toLocaleDateString()}</span>\n                      ${log.fine_amount > 0 ? `<b class=\"text-rose-500\">Fine: ₹${log.fine_amount}</b>` : ''}\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                `).join('')}\n              </div>\n            ` : `\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 py-4 text-center\">No penalty strikes on record. Keep it up!</p>\n            `}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- 2. HEAD CHEF & EVENT MANAGER VIEW -----------------\n\nfunction renderChefView(partitionType = 'hostel') {\n  const currentMeal = state.meals.find(m => m.id === state.selectedMealId) || state.meals[0] || {};\n  const demand = state.chefDemand || {\n    attending_count: 0,\n    opted_out_count: 0,\n    veg_count: 0,\n    non_veg_count: 0,\n    food_saved_kg: 0,\n    item_aggregates: {}\n  };\n\n  return `\n    <div class=\"space-y-8 tab-content-enter\">\n      <!-- Chef Header -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-800\">\n              Kitchen Head Chef Portal\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">${partitionType === 'event' ? 'Event & Banquet Catering' : 'Central Mess Kitchen'}</span>\n          </div>\n          <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1\">Live Demand Forecast & Kitchen Prep Sheet</h1>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Real-time aggregated diner responses and exact item quantities to avoid cooking surplus.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <select id=\"chefMealSelector\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-slate-800\">\n            ${state.meals.map(m => `\n              <option value=\"${m.id}\" ${state.selectedMealId === m.id ? 'selected' : ''}>\n                ${m.title} (${m.partition_type.toUpperCase()})\n              </option>\n            `).join('')}\n          </select>\n          <button id=\"btnOpenNewMealModal\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"plus-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n            New Meal Schedule\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Demand Metric Cards -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold\">\n            <span>Confirmed Diners</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"users\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2 block\">${demand.attending_count}</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-emerald-600 font-medium\">100% committed RSVPs</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold\">\n            <span>Veg vs Non-Veg</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"pie-chart\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-green-600\">${demand.veg_count} <small class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Veg</small></span>\n            <span class=\"text-slate-300\">/</span>\n            <span class=\"text-rose-600\">${demand.non_veg_count} <small class=\"text-xs font-normal\">Non-Veg</small></span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Dietary breakdown</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold\">\n            <span>Opted-Out (Skipping)</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"user-x\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-500\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2 block\">${demand.opted_out_count}</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\">No cooking needed for these</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 border-emerald-200\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">\n            <span>Food Saved (Est.)</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"sparkles\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mt-2 block\">${demand.food_saved_kg} kg</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[11px] text-emerald-800 font-medium\">Prevented kitchen overcook</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Exact Cooking Quota / Prep Sheet Grid -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Exact Cooking Prep Quota for ${currentMeal.title}</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Prepare exactly these quantities based on student selections.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold text-slate-700\">\n            Cutoff: ${currentMeal.cutoff_time}\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n          ${Object.entries(demand.item_aggregates).map(([itemName, data]) => `\n            <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold ${\n                  data.type === 'Veg' ? 'bg-green-100 text-green-800' : data.type === 'Non-Veg' ? 'bg-rose-100 text-rose-800' : 'bg-slate-200 text-slate-800'\n                }\">\n                  ${data.type}\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\">${data.unit}</span>\n              </div>\n              <h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">${itemName}</h4>\n              <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-baseline justify-between border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Total to Cook:</span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-mono\">${data.count} <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500\">${data.unit}</span></span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          `).join('')}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- 3. CANTEEN GATEKEEPER & STRIKE DESK -----------------\n\nfunction renderGatekeeperView() {\n  const currentMeal = state.meals.find(m => m.id === state.selectedMealId) || state.meals[0] || {};\n  const students = state.allUsers.filter(u => u.role === 'student');\n\n  return `\n    <div class=\"space-y-8 tab-content-enter\">\n      <!-- Gatekeeper Header -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800\">\n              Canteen Gate & Penalty Desk\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Turnstile Entry & Tray Return Scanner</span>\n          </div>\n          <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1\">Attendance Verification & Black Star Logging</h1>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Scan student badges on entry and issue Black Stars for no-shows or food wasted on plates.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <select id=\"gatekeeperMealSelector\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-slate-800\">\n          ${state.meals.map(m => `\n            <option value=\"${m.id}\" ${state.selectedMealId === m.id ? 'selected' : ''}>${m.title}</option>\n          `).join('')}\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick Action Terminals Grid -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n        <!-- Card 1: Student Entry Scan Terminal -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"scan\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Canteen Entrance Check-in</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Verify student RSVP ticket upon entering dining hall.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Select Arriving Student / Scan ID:</label>\n              <select id=\"scanStudentSelect\" class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n                ${students.map(s => `\n                  <option value=\"${s.id}\">${s.name} (${s.room_or_dept}) - Stars: ${s.black_stars} ⭐</option>\n                `).join('')}\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <button \n              id=\"btnVerifyEntry\" \n              class=\"w-full py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"\n            >\n              <i data-lucide=\"check-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n              Verify & Check In Student\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Live Entry Scan Result Banner -->\n            <div id=\"entryResultContainer\" class=\"hidden p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-2\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 2: Plate Waste & Strike Enforcement Desk -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <i data-lucide=\"alert-triangle\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Disposal Counter / Penalty Desk</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Flag food waste on tray return or unexcused no-shows (3 strikes = fine).</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Select Offending Student:</label>\n              <select id=\"strikeStudentSelect\" class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800\">\n                ${students.map(s => `\n                  <option value=\"${s.id}\">${s.name} (${s.room_or_dept}) - Current Stars: ${s.black_stars}</option>\n                `).join('')}\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1\">Violation Reason:</label>\n              <select id=\"strikeReasonSelect\" class=\"w-full p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm text-slate-800\">\n                <option value=\"Excessive plate food waste left at tray return\">Excessive plate food waste left at tray return</option>\n                <option value=\"No-show after RSVP commitment (Meal prepared and wasted)\">No-show after RSVP commitment (Meal prepared & wasted)</option>\n                <option value=\"Throwing away untouched food in garbage\">Throwing away untouched food in garbage</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n\n            <button \n              id=\"btnIssueStrike\" \n              class=\"w-full py-3 bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"\n            >\n              <i data-lucide=\"star\" class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-white\"></i>\n              Issue Black Star Strike (+1 ⭐)\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- Strike Result Banner -->\n            <div id=\"strikeResultContainer\" class=\"hidden p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Student Strike Audit Table -->\n      <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Hosteller Black Star Audit Roster</h3>\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs text-slate-600\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 font-bold uppercase border-b border-slate-200\">\n              <tr>\n                <th class=\"p-3\">Student Name</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3\">Room / Dept</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3\">Black Stars</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3\">Penalty Status</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3\">Fine Balance</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-right\">Action</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100\">\n              ${students.map(s => `\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                  <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-slate-900\">${s.name}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3\">${s.room_or_dept}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold ${s.black_stars >= 3 ? 'text-rose-600' : s.black_stars > 0 ? 'text-amber-600' : 'text-slate-400'}\">\n                      ${s.black_stars} ⭐\n                    </span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3\">\n                    ${s.black_stars >= 3 \n                      ? '<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-rose-100 text-rose-700\">FINE PENDING</span>' \n                      : s.black_stars === 2 \n                      ? '<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-700\">FINAL WARNING</span>' \n                      : '<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700\">IN GOOD STANDING</span>'\n                    }\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-slate-900\">₹${s.fines_accumulated || 0}</td>\n                  <td class=\"p-3 text-right\">\n                    <button \n                      class=\"quick-strike-btn text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-100 font-bold rounded-lg border border-rose-200\"\n                      data-user-id=\"${s.id}\"\n                    >\n                      +1 Star\n                    </button>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              `).join('')}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n}\n\n// ----------------- 4. CIRCULAR WASTE REDISTRIBUTION HUB -----------------\n\nfunction renderWasteHubView() {\n  const isBiogas = state.currentRole === 'biogas_official';\n  const roleTitle = isBiogas ? 'Biogas Management Official' : 'Animal Feed Rescue Partner';\n  const wasteList = state.wasteLogs || [];\n\n  return `\n    <div class=\"space-y-8 tab-content-enter\">\n      <!-- Official Header -->\n      <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r ${isBiogas ? 'from-amber-700 to-orange-900' : 'from-sky-800 to-indigo-950'} rounded-3xl p-6 lg:p-8 text-white shadow-xl\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-xs text-white